# SHELL - THE ADMIRAL COMMAND SHELL AS USER CODE.
#   SHELL = LOAD("SHELL")
#   SHELL()
# EACH LINE RUNS IN THE ROOT SCOPE WITH REPL SEMANTICS (AUTO-PRINT AND
# '_' BINDING) VIA EXEC(). ON A PANIC THE KERNEL ERROR HANDLER RESTARTS
# SHELL AUTOMATICALLY (AS LONG AS THE GLOBAL NAME SHELL STAYS BOUND).
# EDIT THIS FILE TO CUSTOMIZE THE PROMPT OR ADD STARTUP COMMANDS.
WHILE 1:
  EXEC(INPUT("] "))
